 "about": "HumanoidArena benchmark (G1 with Dex3 hands, native TWIST2 tracker, target=truth), the one task the seed skill covers: pp_box (pick up the box and place it on the shelf). Episodes are `pp_box/<pool>/<n>` (20 per seed group): the diagnostic pool is the practice pool P (the first 10 indices); the acceptance pool is a block of 32 consecutive indices of the pool A and the sealed pool one of 30 of the pool S, both at an offset a hidden seed chooses; the benchmark's 60 evaluation seeds per task are no pool. One Isaac server at a time on GPU 1 (an episode takes one to three minutes). Bench variant (TODO 49.7a): runs on the bench adapter locomani.bench.humanoidarena through the generic backend (backend_bench.py); the package is the adapter's seed (skill.py, frozen __init__.py).",
